#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:192
msgid "Hue, Saturation, Value"
msgstr "Färgton, färgmättnad, värde"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:194
msgid ""
"Identical to :ref:`option_hue_sat_val_pixel` in the Pixel Brush Engine, this "
"will adjust the current foreground color before it is mixed in via :ref:"
"`option_color_rate`. Introduced because this brush engine used to have a "
"small rounding error leading to iridescent smears, which was fixed. Artists "
"who liked this effect can now emulate it by enabling :guilabel:`Hue`, "
"enabling :guilabel:`Fuzzy Dab` and disabling :guilabel:`Pressure` and "
"finally setting :guilabel:`Strength` to 40%."
msgstr ""
"Identisk med :ref:`option_hue_sat_val_pixel` i Bildpunktspenselgränssnittet, "
"och justerar befintlig förgrundsfärg innan den blandas i via :ref:"
"`option_color_rate`. Introducerad eftersom penselgränssnittet brukade ha ett "
"litet avrundningsfel som orsakade iriserande kladd, vilket har rättats. "
"Konstnärer som gillade effekten kan nu emulera den genom att aktivera :"
"guilabel:`Färgton`, aktivera :guilabel:`Suddigt klick`, inaktivera :guilabel:"
"`Tryck` och slutligen ställa in :guilabel:`Styrka` till 40 %."

